		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonsoir,</p><p>Cela semble normal.<br />Il faut également le paquet <strong>postgresql-12-postgis-2.5-scripts</strong> (<em>&quot;To create the PostGIS extensions in a PostgreSQL 12 database, the<br />postgresql-12-postgis-2.5-scripts package must be installed as well</em>&quot; d&#039;après <a href="https://www.ubuntuupdates.org/package/postgresql/xenial-pgdg/main/base/postgresql-12-postgis-2.5)" rel="nofollow">https://www.ubuntuupdates.org/package/p … stgis-2.5)</a></p>]]></content>
